{"id":"NCT06628908","title":"Evaluation of Efficacy and Safety of Suzetrigine for Pain Associated With Diabetic Peripheral Neuropathy","official":"A Phase 3, Randomized, Double-blind, Placebo- and Active-Controlled Study of the Efficacy and Safety of Suzetrigine in Subjects With Pain Associated With Diabetic Peripheral Neuropathy","summary":"The purpose of this study is to evaluate the efficacy, safety, and tolerability of Suzetrigine (SUZ) in participants with pain associated with diabetic peripheral neuropathy (DPN).","conditions":["Diabetic Peripheral Neuropathic Pain"],"interventions":[{"type":"DRUG","name":"Suzetrigine"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"Placebo (matched to SUZ)"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"Pregabalin"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"Placebo (matched to Pregabalin)"}],"criteria":"Key Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Body weight greater than or equal to (≥) 45 kilogram (kg)\n* Body mass index (BMI) ≥18.0 to less than (\\<) 40.0 kilogram per meter square (kg/m\\^2)\n* Diagnosis of diabetes mellitus type 1 or type 2 by glycosylated hemoglobin A1c (HbA1c) ≤9% and the presence of bilateral pain in lower extremities due to DPN\n* Weekly average of daily NPRS score ≥4 and less than or equal to (≤) 9 with limited variation in the 7-day Baseline Period\n\nKey Exclusion Criteria:\n\n* More than 3 missing daily NPRS scores during the 7-day Baseline Period\n* Any sensory abnormality (excluding DPN) as pre-specified in the protocol\n\nOther protocol defined Inclusion/Exclusion criteria may apply.","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"80 Years","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"TREATMENT","enrollment":1100,"start":"2024-10-01","pcd":"2027-05-31","upd":"2026-10-15","sponsor":"Vertex Pharmaceuticals Incorporated","areas":["neurology"],"central":["Medical Information · 617-341-6777 · medicalinfo@vrtx.com"],"sites":[{"f":"Pinnacle Research Group, LLC","city":"Anniston","pr":"Alabama","zip":"36207","s":"R","lat":33.6598,"lon":-85.8316,"c":""},{"f":"Synexus Clinical R